Error [E0311]: `encode` is forbidden on secret-bearing `Secret`
  --> tests/ui/crypto_secret_serialize.jet:6:17
    |
  6 |     _ :: secret.encode()
    |                 ^^^^^^
 Why: secret-bearing cryptographic values are move-only and expose no clone, hash, serialization, Debug, or Display capability
 Fix: move the value to its next owner; use only a named `core.crypto.expert` exposure inside an audited `#Unsafe` region when raw bytes are required
